Description: TURN/STUN relay - eturnal answers, DUB issues credentials it accepts
Network: ../zombienet-configs/local-dev.toml
Creds: config

# ============================================
# Prerequisites
# ============================================

# DUB does not bind its HTTP port until People Chain answers.
people-collator1: is up

alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 is registered within 400 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 block height is at least 5 within 500 seconds

# ============================================
# Relay
# ============================================

# STUN Binding, then a JWT -> POST /api/v1/turn/issue, then a TURN Allocate with those
# credentials. The allocation is the assertion that turn-api and eturnal agree on the
# secret and realm; a wrong password must still be refused.
people-collator1: js-script ./scripts/dist/test-turn.js return is equal to 1 within 600 seconds
